  "headline": "Beigadr the Feared guide (God of War Ragnarok): visibility-first vs teleports and lightning pressure",
  "description": "Beigadr punishes target fixation. Prioritize tracking and visibility, then punish only at end-of-string recoveries.",
  "keywords": [
    "beigadr the feared guide",
    "berserker",
    "teleport",
    "lightning",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\n- losing track after teleports\n- eating lightning pressure while over-chasing\n\n2) Prep\n- one reset relic for spacing\n- short runics for hit-and-run confirms\n\n3) Fixed plan\n1) do not over-chase; stabilize camera and spacing\n2) respect major lightning casts with distance\n3) punish once after teleport strings\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- post-teleport string recovery\n- post-lightning special recovery\n- end of gap-closers\n\nRelated: return to the all-Berserkers index for the full route.",
